=== HARD FACTS (verified, not vibes) ===
- WASM .NET 10 = single thread. While a search grinds, JS can't call in. Anything LIVE
  either binds before boot (jimmolate) or acts only at cooperative yield points.
- The additional-filter chain is a FUNNEL: survivors of filter N re-pack into filter N+1's
  batch (MotelySearch.cs:1515/1583). That IS the SIMD narrowing. Jimmolate's no-mask
  SearchIndividualSeeds is correct ONLY as a tail behind real must-clauses.
- Scoring is a separate post-funnel stage (MotelySearch.cs:1265). Jimmolate today runs as
  an additional filter (below scoring); user wants it ABOVE scoring. Not done.
- CLAUDE22 / Erratic / White: ante 1 = Boss The Manacle, Voucher Paint Brush. Ante 7 shop
  #20 = Lucky Cat. Ante 3 has Immolate in a Jumbo Spectral Pack.

